0011B0  2  AD DD 16             LDA     PTEMPW+1        ; Load the high byte of the first number
0011B3  2  6D DF 16             ADC     PTEMPW1+1       ; Add the high byte of the second number (plus carry from previous op)
0011B6  2  85 FE                STA     TEMPW+1         ; Store the high byte of the result
