00140C  3  A2 26                LDX     #$26            ; IO ERROR
00140E  3  20 E2 1F             JSR     LAB_XERR
001411  3  4C BA 20             JMP     LAB_1319        ; RESET VARS, STACK AND RETURN CONTROL TO BASIC
